    For either sequence $G = P \, Q$, convexity gives $G_n - G_(n - 1) gt.eq G_n \/ n$.
    Put $beta_j = w_(j + 1) \/ w_j$. For $n gt.eq 1$,
  $ beta_(- n) = e^(- \( P_n - P_(n - 1) \)) lt.eq w_(- n)^(- 1 \/ n) \, wide beta_(n - 1) =
