  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(4)")
   $ beta_j lt.eq 1 \, wide sum_(j in bb(Z)) beta_j < oo . $ <eq:p3-ratio-sum>]
  In particular, $R$ is bounded. If $\| c_j \| w_j lt.eq 1$ and $\| b_j \| \/ w_j lt.eq 1$,
    then for each integer $r gt.eq 1$,
  $ sum_j \| b_j c_(j - r) \| lt.eq sum_j w_j / w_(j - r) lt.eq sum_j beta_(j - r) < oo . $
  We prove the following support assertion: if nonzero $b \, c$ satisfy these bounds and
  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(5)")
